cmu-colony-supervisors-colonist = the colony administration

cmu-colony-name-chaplain = Colony Chaplain
cmu-colony-description-chaplain = Keep the colony's faith alive. Bless the living, console the dying, and bury the rest.
cmu-colony-prefix-chaplain = CHAP

cmu-colony-name-xenoarchaeologist = Colony Xenoarchaeologist
cmu-colony-description-xenoarchaeologist = Study the ruins and remains of whatever lived here before the colony did. Try not to wake anything up.
cmu-colony-prefix-xenoarchaeologist = XARC

cmu-colony-name-xenobiologist = Colony Xenobiologist
cmu-colony-description-xenobiologist = Study the local biosphere, licensed and documented. Mostly.
cmu-colony-prefix-xenobiologist = XBIO

cmu-colony-name-pmc-medic = Colony PMC Medic
cmu-colony-description-pmc-medic = A private military contractor medic stationed at the colony, contractually obligated to keep everyone breathing.
cmu-colony-prefix-pmc-medic = MED

cmu-colony-name-ministry-doctor = Colony Ministry of Health Doctor
cmu-colony-description-ministry-doctor = A doctor of the Ministry of Health, tending to the workers of a far-flung industrial colony with dwindling supplies.
cmu-colony-prefix-ministry-doctor = MOH

cmu-colony-name-reactor-technician = Colony Reactor Technician
cmu-colony-description-reactor-technician = A civilian reactor technician, the only thing standing between the colony and a very warm future.
cmu-colony-prefix-reactor-technician = RCT

cmu-colony-name-panic-room-commando = Panic Room Commando
cmu-colony-description-panic-room-commando = A Weyland-Yutani commando sealed in the site's panic room when everything went wrong. The door just opened, and outside is not what you were briefed to expect.
cmu-colony-prefix-panic-room-commando = PRC

cmu-colony-name-prison-guard = Prison Guard
cmu-colony-description-prison-guard = A corrections officer at the colony's penal annex. The inmates outnumbered you before the evacuation, and now nobody is leaving.
cmu-colony-prefix-prison-guard = PSG

cmu-colony-name-riot-control-officer = Riot Control Officer
cmu-colony-description-riot-control-officer = CMB riot control, kitted to hold a line the colony no longer has. The crowd scattered hours ago; something else took their place.
cmu-colony-prefix-riot-control-officer = RCO
cmu-colony-name-riot-control-team-leader = Riot Control Team Leader
cmu-colony-description-riot-control-team-leader = The officer in charge of the CMB riot detail. Your orders stopped making sense two channels ago, so you make your own.
cmu-colony-prefix-riot-control-team-leader = RCL

cmu-cmb-name-bureau-observer = CMB Bureau Observer
cmu-cmb-description-bureau-observer = A field observer of the Colonial Marshals Bureau, sent to watch, record, and render aid, never to take sides.
cmu-cmb-prefix-bureau-observer = OBS
cmu-cmb-supervisors-bureau = the Colonial Marshals Bureau
cmu-cmb-rules-bureau-observer = You are a Bureau Observer. You are neutral to every faction. Observe, record, and render medical aid where needed, but do not take sides in the fighting.
